# Gradio runtime folders.
.gradio/
flagged/

# KEEP (tracked on purpose):
#   data/labels.json   ground truth
#   data/scenes/*.flac the exact test audio (about 29 MB). edge-tts output can drift slightly, so these
#                      files are what make the reported numbers exactly reproducible.
#   results/           the evidence: report.md, metrics.json, timelines.json, failures_*.md, events/

